      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Pulse points. Wrists, neck, inside of the elbow. At Coachella you have heat working for you all day, and heat is what keeps a fragrance developing. The desert warmth does the work. One application in the morning and a light refresh in the afternoon is all you need. Skip spraying it on your clothes. Fabric holds scent differently than skin and you lose the warmth and development that makes a great <a href=\"/collections/women\" title=\"Women\">women's fragrance</a> worth wearing in the first place.</p>"
      }
    },
    "1779098566fe093063": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_tNDHUV": {
          "type": "editorial--text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DAY ONE, GATES JUST OPENED: LIBERTY (inspired by Libre by YSL)",
            "heading_size": 48,
            "heading_size_mobile": 32,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "heading_color": "#121212",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 50,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 30,
            "column_1_text": "<p>Day one energy is specific. You drove out from LA or flew in, the line at check-in was longer than it needed to be, and none of that matters now because you are here and the music is already playing somewhere in the distance. Liberty is the right scent for this moment. Inspired by YSL's Libre, it opens with lavender and citrus, moves into white florals, and settles into a warm musk that carries beautifully when the temperature climbs. A long-lasting perfume for women that knows exactly what kind of day this is.</p><p></p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>This is a fragrance that opens well in sunshine and stays interesting through a full afternoon. Day one calls for it. Liberty delivers.</p>",
            "body_size": 22,
            "body_size_mobile": 16,
            "body_line_height": 1.6,
            "body_color": "#121212",
            "paragraph_spacing": 16,
            "column_gap": 60,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1400,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "padding_top": 40,
            "padding_bottom": 40,
            "padding_horizontal": 20,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_tNDHUV"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "editorial--content",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>THE AFTERNOON DRIFT: FATE <strong> </strong>(inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel)</p>",
            "heading_size": 50,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Nobody has a fixed plan in the afternoon at Coachella. You are wandering between stages, catching half a set, running into someone you know from back home, making your way toward the main stage without quite getting there yet. Fate was made for this. Inspired by Chanel's Chance, it opens with pink pepper and jasmine over a vetiver base. Fresh enough for the heat, grounded enough to carry you through golden hour without fading out.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "<p>One of the top <a href=\"/collections/women\" title=\"Women\">perfumes for women</a> who want something that keeps up with a day that has absolutely no structure and no apologies for it.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>FOR THE HEADLINER: FEMININE FANCY (inspired by Good Girl by Carolina Herrera)</p>",
            "subheading_size": 50,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 10,
            "bottom_text": "<p>The headliner set is when everything comes together. The crowd fills in, the energy shifts, and you have been on your feet since noon. The desert cools just enough to feel like a reward. Feminine Fancy is built for this moment. Inspired by Good Girl by Carolina Herrera, it leads with coffee and jasmine over a tonka bean base that has real staying power without going heavy in the heat.</p><p>Bold enough to land at close range in a crowd. Warm enough to feel right when the temperature finally drops. This is the scent you reach for when the day earns it.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 22,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
    "blocks_4efdfV": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_VJ4Rgi": {
          "type": "editorial--text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FOR THE AFTER PARTY: BLACK POISON (inspired by Black Opium by YSL)",
            "heading_size": 48,
            "heading_size_mobile": 32,
            "heading_line_height": 1.2,
            "heading_color": "#121212",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 50,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 30,
            "column_1_text": "<p>The after-party at Coachella is its own category of experience. It happens late, it goes later than you planned, and the best ones feel like a different event entirely from what came before. Black Poison belongs here. Inspired by Black Opium, this is coffee and white floral over a vanilla base. Rich without being heavy. Confident without being loud.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>A luxury inspired perfume that makes it look like you planned every part of tonight, even though the real plan was mostly just following good music to wherever it led. It fits in a crossbody. It goes the distance.</p>",
            "body_size": 22,
            "body_size_mobile": 16,
            "body_line_height": 1.6,
            "body_color": "#121212",
            "paragraph_spacing": 16,
            "column_gap": 60,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1400,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "padding_top": 40,
            "padding_bottom": 40,
            "padding_horizontal": 20,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_VJ4Rgi"
